 "_comment": "Per-SKU order limits, in two tiers. `limits` is the EXTERNAL tier and is the default on purpose: if the staff override below never runs, everyone gets the tighter partner numbers, which fails safe. `internal` is applied on top for Millboard staff only, by the mb_sof_sku_limits filter in the wc-account-sample-ordering component.",
 "_external_source": "Millboard_sample_ordering_audit_DH.xlsx, column I 'APPROVED MAX QTY', signed off by Dan Hernandez 30 Sep 2026. His note: these limits are for external requests from distributors and customers via the partner portal ONLY, not for internal teams.",
 "_internal_source": "HOLDING VALUES, NOT APPROVED. Carried over unchanged from the portal export of 23 Sep 2026 so that nothing changes for internal teams. Dan has said a separate internal maximum is still to be set; replacing this block is how it lands.",
